    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "CONTROLS:\n\u2022 W / A / S / D : Move Character\n\u2022 Mouse Movement
    : Look & Aim Camera\n\u2022 Left Mouse Button (LMB) : Shoot / Light Attack\n\u2022
    Right Mouse Button (RMB) : Aim Down Sights (ADS)\n\u2022 Q Key : Super Charged
    Attack\n\u2022 Left Ctrl : Lock-On / Unlock Enemy Target\n\u2022 E Key : Interact
    / Talk to NPCs / Purchase Relics\n\u2022 V Key : Toggle Shoulder Camera Side\n\u2022
    Esc Key : Pause / Resume Game\n\nMISSION OBJECTIVE:\nExplore each biome, defeat
    hostile beasts to fulfill NPC missions,\ncollect coins, restore ancient Relics,
    and unlock the portal to the Sanctuary!"
